The research focuses on high-accuracy SLAM in GPS-denied environments, progressing from simulation to field experiments. It also contributed to a large-scale victim-detection dataset for model training.', 'Ongoing research', 'Sep 2025', 'Present', array['Autonomous Systems', 'ROS 2', 'LiDAR SLAM', 'UAVs'], array['DJI Matrice 350 RTK', 'NVIDIA Jetson Orin NX', 'Velodyne LiDAR', 'Intel RealSense', 'ROS 2'], array['High-accuracy 3D mapping in GPS-denied environments.', 'DJI Payload SDK integration with edge computing and multi-sensor payloads.', 'Contributed to an 18,000-image victim-detection dataset.'], true, 1);
insert into public.projects (slug, title, subtitle, summary, description, status, start_date, end_date, tags, tools, outcomes, featured, sort_order) values ('autonomous-medical-search-rescue-robot', 'Autonomous Medical Search & Rescue Robot', 'TÜBİTAK 2209 · Multimodal Rescue Platform', 'A multi-sensor rescue platform powered by Jetson TX2 that combines thermal and RGB vision, bio-radar, LoRa, and local voice guidance.', 'An autonomous search-and-rescue platform designed to identify signs of life and hazardous conditions in disaster sites. It fuses thermal and RGB cameras with bio-radar and uses LoRa for long-range communication.

The design includes Cognitive Override and Wake-on-Suspect mechanisms to reduce power consumption, alongside a local LLM-assisted voice interface for initial guidance before rescue teams arrive.', 'Ongoing research', 'Feb 2026', 'Present', array['Search & Rescue', 'Sensor Fusion', 'Edge AI', 'LoRa'], array['NVIDIA Jetson TX2', 'Thermal + RGB Cameras', 'Bio-Radar', 'LoRa', 'Local LLM / TTS'], array['Designed a multi-sensor survivor-search architecture.', 'Integrated preliminary health alerts with a local voice interface.', 'Improved power consumption through Wake-on-Suspect logic.'], true, 2);
insert into public.projects (slug, title, subtitle, summary, description, status, start_date, end_date, tags, tools, outcomes, featured, sort_order) values ('three-axis-robotic-arm', '3-Axis Robotic Arm Modeling & Control', 'Mechanical Design · Kinematics · PID Control', 'Mechanical design and kinematic analysis for a three-axis robotic arm, with MATLAB and Simulink PID control simulation before production.', 'This project brings together mechanical design and control. The structure was designed in SolidWorks, followed by motion modeling and kinematic analysis to validate motion ranges and precision.

Before fabrication, PID control logic was evaluated in MATLAB and Simulink to study response behavior and improve precise motion across all three axes.', 'Completed', '2024', '2024', array['Robotics', 'SolidWorks', 'PID Control', 'MATLAB'], array['SolidWorks', 'MATLAB', 'Simulink', 'PID Control'], array['Designed a manufacturable three-axis structure.', 'Completed kinematic analysis for workspace validation.', 'Simulated control behavior before production.'], true, 3);
